{"v":4,"catch":"現在是新事物的時候了！","desc":"《NEW RALLY-X》是NAMCO於1981年發行的動作遊戲。\n這項工作是對以前的 RALLY-X 的完整模型更改。\n體驗與紅色汽車相同的驚險追逐，現在更輕鬆的遊戲玩法。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-02-03","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/40f9f01ee2abb3f9afa4bdcb73d78b2ee5b276306b03a0975ee9c8980df64190.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d199be7ebbb865fd50c9bd2b87a2be869f7b5243a117a722fa6d876adb4a0e3d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/32ecdef170943fa65bbe133e0581e5fa84c8a268cd8bf6bb1f48fcf76b4e77a9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2703000782b6272869dc705c760a36a6434a2dde2db2432d236891dc5d3f4d86.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/00b72e92a354534ccc2e39fbdf3c39a2545e4ac715e5e6edc9d94a667e068a32.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9a9c5a496d22dd4ac03cca702d5782cb96091e84a9617620a0954e028b47df71.jpg"],"titleId":"0100ef3016d2a000","dlc":[]}